{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783800/extras/145c9c57e9869e4b967c0915d24f171a.poster.avif?t=1768246972\" width=800 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783800/extras/145c9c57e9869e4b967c0915d24f171a.webm?t=1768246972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783800/extras/145c9c57e9869e4b967c0915d24f171a.mp4?t=1768246972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783800/extras/22bad8d1260bd196325b9e2a75cfb1ee.avif?t=1768246972\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783800/extras_big/22bad8d1260bd196325b9e2a75cfb1ee.webp?t=1768246972 width=1560 height=112 /></span>The world, after a nuclear devastation, fell under the totalitarian regime of ELYSION. This oppressive system controls people with chips implanted in their minds; perceptions, memories, and reality are now in their hands. You are an insider: a doctor who served the regime for years, but now sees the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hands that once witnessed the development of chip technology are now sparking a rebellion, stretching from decaying experimental centers to dark underground shelters. Trapped between reality and the hallucinations plaguing your mind, breaking the system's chains is your only hope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break the system. Free your mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783800/extras/c5d818c00196e42b966b9b5b3cd3df59.avif?t=1768246972\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783800/extras_big/c5d818c00196e42b966b9b5b3cd3df59.webp?t=1768246972 width=1560 height=112 /></span>Abandoned labs, ruined city remnants, and underground shelters monitored at every corner... Infected Soul brings a decaying dystopia to life with hyper-realistic visuals and striking use of light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783800/extras/d6daa5218dabbfaa879451ea1b6919b0.poster.avif?t=1768246972\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783800/extras/d6daa5218dabbfaa879451ea1b6919b0.webm?t=1768246972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783800/extras/d6daa5218dabbfaa879451ea1b6919b0.mp4?t=1768246972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783800/extras/9ab5fe7316a2a3e8ddc58f4c7b2d3fc1.avif?t=1768246972\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783800/extras_big/9ab5fe7316a2a3e8ddc58f4c7b2d3fc1.webp?t=1768246972 width=1560 height=112 /></span>The botched chip procedure shattered your mind. Hallucinations, delusions, and traumas are now indistinguishable from reality. Voices, images, even enemies might be products of your own mind. Your greatest threat... might just be you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783800/extras/fd2f04c5c2504dc6ecdc078c62a10177.poster.avif?t=1768246972\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783800/extras/fd2f04c5c2504dc6ecdc078c62a10177.webm?t=1768246972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783800/extras/fd2f04c5c2504dc6ecdc078c62a10177.mp4?t=1768246972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783800/extras/e255a648cedfffc968b5397e664ffa4a.avif?t=1768246972\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783800/extras_big/e255a648cedfffc968b5397e664ffa4a.webp?t=1768246972 width=1560 height=112 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go beyond just using weapons \u2013 hide, distract, and use the environment to your advantage.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reality is twisted. Fight against hallucinations, delusions, and paranoia.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your voice and presence shape the game; panic is now real.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team-based missions demand cooperation and strategy.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mission features a unique atmosphere, enemies, and consequences. Your choices impact the entire team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783800/extras/6dc345e5aabb3dfe767e855da5db7c56.poster.avif?t=1768246972\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783800/extras/6dc345e5aabb3dfe767e855da5db7c56.webm?t=1768246972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783800/extras/6dc345e5aabb3dfe767e855da5db7c56.mp4?t=1768246972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783800/extras/b1faf49877f179fa396934abfbc333f0.avif?t=1768246972\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783800/extras_big/b1faf49877f179fa396934abfbc333f0.webp?t=1768246972 width=1560 height=112 /></span>Infected Soul can be played with 1 to 4 players. Choose to go solo or tackle missions with your team. Each mission will have you exploring a different lab, with varying threats, puzzles, and atmosphere every time. But beware\u2014the system doesn't show everyone the same thing. Reality is different for each player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783800/extras/33a7c193c58b07515b70360551684d75.poster.avif?t=1768246972\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783800/extras/33a7c193c58b07515b70360551684d75.webm?t=1768246972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783800/extras/33a7c193c58b07515b70360551684d75.mp4?t=1768246972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3783800?t=1768246972","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783800/a592fd303551f989cc56892b39884aafd6c1fbd5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768246972","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783800/87e791b7b84d9e30f551531967b2575853a6f4e1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768246972","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783800/87e791b7b84d9e30f551531967b2575853a6f4e1/capsule_